# Regenerated local state, not config. cache/ and .cache/ hold rendered
# widget snapshots, server-action caches, and agent-turn/ACP session data
# (actual coding-agent transcript content) that must never land in this
# PUBLIC repo. baby-menu.db is app-local sqlite state, currently empty with
# no schema. Mirrors home/.config/nvim/.gitignore's precedent for keeping
# generated content out of an otherwise-tracked symlinked directory.
cache/
.cache/
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
